# ============================================================================
# .env.shared - SOFT tier. Readable by Claude, safe to surface in conversation.
# STILL gitignored (readable != committed). Values EMPTY on purpose.
#
# Put here ONLY values that grant nothing to whoever reads them:
#   - contact / notify email addresses
#   - a public base URL, a feature flag, a non-secret ID
#
# Do NOT put here: any webhook URL (Slack, Discord, n8n, Zapier, ...), because the
# URL itself is the credential and anyone holding it can post or trigger through
# it; nor anything ending in _SECRET / _KEY / _TOKEN / _PASSWORD. Those are HARD:
# they go in .env (or ~/.claude/.env), and programs use them by variable name.
# ============================================================================

# CONTACT_EMAIL=
# NOTIFY_EMAIL=
# PUBLIC_BASE_URL=
